x":"And based on strong operating fundamentals that we've discussed, and our positioning entering the spring leasing season, we've increased our guidance range for full-year FFO per share by nearly 2% or $0.03 per share at the midpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cubesmart-cube-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q2","e":"cube","d":"2021-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher Marr","x":"Broad-based consumer demand for our space, when combined with positive trends in customer behavior, has contributed to our record levels of physical occupancy and an extremely strong pricing power across our portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cubesmart-cube-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q2","e":"cube","d":"2021-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher Marr","x":"This pricing power has continued into the third quarter and is contributing to our significantly raised expectations for the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cubesmart-cube-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q2","e":"cube","d":"2021-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher Marr","x":"…active during the quarter within our joint venture structure, focusing on lease-up opportunities and as evidenced by our increased guidance for external growth, we anticipate sourcing additional opportunities for non-stabilized assets, both on balance sheet and within our joint venture structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cubesmart-cube-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q2","e":"cube","d":"2021-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Timothy Martin","x":"Based on the strong operating fundamentals we've discussed, we've increased our guidance range for the full year of FFO per share by nearly 10% or $0.18 per share at the midpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cubesmart-cube-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q3","e":"cube","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. Martin","x":"Strong demand continued to be evidenced not only a high level of physical occupancy, but also in strong pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/cubesmart-cube-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q3","e":"cube","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher P. Marr","x":"Looking forward, we remain bullish on fundamentals as evidenced by our increased guidance, which Tim will get into with more detail in his commentary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/cubesmart-cube-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2021 Q3","e":"cube","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. Martin","x":"Based on the strong operating fundamentals we've discussed, we've increased our guidance range for full-year FFO per share by 4.2% at the midpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/cubesmart-cube-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2025 Q3","e":"cube","d":"2025-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Timothy M. Martin","x":"When you have if you have that type of pricing power, normal pricing power over a prolonged period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/cubesmart-cube-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2025 Q3","e":"cube","d":"2025-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher P. Marr","x":"We've seen some better pricing power that started earlier in the year, for the reasons I've previously shared.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/cubesmart-cube-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CUBE 2025 Q4","e":"cube","d":"2026-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Juan Carlos Sanabria",